  "credit": "Models by jelaludo (https://jelaludo.github.io/SentryTowers_A6/): SOL-88 Syzygy orbital laser, ARC-01 mass driver and SEED-01 collector satellite, LIT-01 chip writer, VER-01 greenhouse, the settlement cassette and the research outpost garage, reused with attribution under the upstream ASSET-LICENSE.md",
  "note": "THE COLONY GROWS (owner, 2026-10-01: the A6 workshop survey). The lod1 game tiers and, for the landmarks the camera can stand far from, the authored lod2 as the far tier; plain GLB pinned, the build packs them. SOL-88 is the briefing, the wireframe reveal and the Units lab only, so lod1 alone. The ARC-01 and SEED-01 clips are engine-driven upstream (runtime.js), not baked: src/fx/arc-launch.js drives the named nodes. The garage has no authored tiers: its far tier is derived by npm run tiers. The ammunition's three biggest game-tier projectiles (owner, 2026-10-02: \"add missiles of various sizes ... on the ground near the robotic assembly\") dress the armory's reload pad beside the assembly line.",
